        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:issue"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n4. The impugned order of detention is challenged by the petitioner primarily on the following grounds:-\n(i) That the impugned order suffers from non-application of mind."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "419579fa856a4babb8cd498c2fd3374e_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Having heard the learned counsel for the parties and perused the material on record, I am of the considered opinion that the grounds of detention, on the basis of which the petitioner has been put under preventive detention, are totally vag"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "49fb674ac436479583f84b6728be1049_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS",
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
            "matched_text": "quashed",
            "start": 135,
            "end": 142
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "The impugned order, passed on the basis of such grounds of detention, is, on the face of it, not sustainable in law and deserves to be quashed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "116342c47ce74466ac3cf4457d6f7ee6_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "7. From reading of grounds of detention it clearly transpires that the petitioner has been detained under Section 8 of the Public Safety Act, 1978, for his activities calculated to endanger the security of the State."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "de0411f7d1244ed3a947bcf8b50c5cfe_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is reference to the petitioner making inflammatory and highly objectionable speeches and motivating the masses to choose the path of violence to create serious law and order problem in the District of Rajouri."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b5a86cd0fbca49d6bf8f92b8adcdc141_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is no date, month or year indicated in the grounds of detention on which the petitioner allegedly made the inflammatory and objectionable speeches."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4a72d907a0fb46d4871c19a1e7314cf6_25",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is also not forthcoming from the grounds of detention whether these inflammatory and objectionable speeches are with a view to over off the authority of the State or create any situation prejudicial to the security of the State."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "87f0b82f0fe541fd83c9303b1a0cf21d_26",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is rather reference to the creation of law and order problem in the District of Rajouri by the youth who get inspired by such speeches."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "22bc2e74cab54449889b7b2ef285f63c_27",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is also interesting to note that despite the petitioner having been indulging in making inflammatory and highly objectionable speeches, has not been booked in any criminal case."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1e478fb0b39e434388cf62054ba0b36a_28",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The only FIR which is referred to in the grounds of detention is FIR No. 31/2023 registered under Section 212 IPC at Police Station Budhal."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3d7dcb4fecd9431abbc922aa83ce10a6_29",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "8. From the brief facts narrated in reference to the aforesaid FIR, it would transpire that even the offence under Section 212 IPC is not prima facie made against the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f21a60966ada4a478f7eb3a93f1e0bc0_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There are serious allegations of harboring the militants leveled against the petitioner but there is no mention as to the identity of a person who has been horboured or concealed by the petitioner with an intention of screening him from leg"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "5c49750676a64dbbbbff874cbe9fdbdb_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the absence of any named offender who is allegedly harboured, it is prima facie not tenable to book a person for commission of offence punishable under Section 212 IPC."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e6c5888b952d4dd68e76a83c82559bf0_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Without commenting upon the merits of the FIR, which will ultimately be subject to determination by the competent Court, suffice it to say that mere narration of activities,\nwithout there being any iota of material in support thereof, canno"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "881085268c584ac2a334eb8adb1ecce5_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The grounds of detention are totally vague,\nuncertain and in the nature of storytelling and, therefore, do not furnish requisite material required for making subjective satisfaction with regard to the necessity of placing the petitioner und"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "12eda7e881fa434aa1995278825a7c4d_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There is nothing in the grounds of detention to suggest that why the petitioner, who is already booked in FIR No. 31/2023 under Section 212 IPC registered at Police Station Budhal, cannot be dealt with under the ordinary law."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bb73fb56774a4bb48a8d4dc8edf218f4_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. Otherwise also, from perusal of detention records produced by the respondents, it clearly transpires that the impugned order of detention was executed on 01-08-2023 and at the time of execution of the detention order the petitioner was o"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0f3774c5ce7e48728ebecf5aabd4ebe3_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The petitioner was not provided any other material,\nin particular copy of the FIR No. 31/2023 registered at Police Station Budhal."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f544c0d88312426db679f6b94daf20f1_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The other material like delivery of inflammatory speeches by the petitioner, which is though lacking material particulars, too has not been supplied to the petitioner."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "34017500a55e4c2aa764da07dbea43a2_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In this way the petitioner has been deprived Mohd Altaf Age 45 Years vs Union Territory Of Jammu And Kashmir on 2 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/131894743/\n3 of his fundamental right of making representation against"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "4353ba88dec3463cb1ae49abea45f26f_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nIn taking this view, I am supported by a judgment of Honble the Supreme Court delivered in Thahira Haris etc. v. Government of Karnataka, (2009) 11 SCC 438, wherein it has been held thus:-\n\"28."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cff8037e9d9b4b81933ff629bedae6f0_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "PRE_RELIED"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Our Constitution provides adequate safeguards under clauses (5) and (6) of Article 22 to the detenu who has been detained in pursuance of the order made under any law providing for preventive detention."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "eba7df90b2c14d0a9e048f340bc8b936_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "He has right to be supplied copies of all documents, statements and other materials relied upon in the grounds of detention without any delay."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f4d5cf68cd7f474790371b118f2df9ff_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The predominant object of communicating the grounds of detention is to enable the detenu at the earliest opportunity to make effective and meaningful representation against his detention.\"\n10."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a01ef162956c4520870ecca944a5cf6f_43",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "For the foregoing reasons, I find merit in this petition and the same is, accordingly, allowed."
      },
